  "system": {
    "summary": {
      "value": ""
    },
    "description": "<p>During a conflict, you may use an action to perform a <strong>【DEX + WLP】</strong> Check against the Magic Defense of an enemy you can see. If you succeed and that enemy is a <strong>soldier</strong>, you regain <strong>【SL】</strong> Inventory Points; if they are an <strong>elite</strong> or <strong>champion</strong>, the GM gives you their <strong>soul treasure</strong>, an item worth an amount of zenit <strong>equal to or lower than 【the enemy's level multiplied by 30, or by 50 if they are a Villain】</strong>. This <strong>soul treasure</strong> appears in your <strong>backpack</strong>. The same character can be successfully stolen from only once, but if they appear again with a different game profile, they can be stolen from again.</p><p>You gain a bonus equal to <strong>【SL】</strong> to your <strong>【DEX + WLP】</strong> Checks for this Skill.</p>",
